{"id":"nebel","lemma":"Nebel","pos":"noun","rank":2784,"glosses":["fog, mist, haze","nebula"],"ipa":"/ˈneːbəl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/De-Nebel.ogg/De-Nebel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Nebels","plural":"Nebel"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich sah nichts außer Nebel.","en":"I could see nothing but fog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717869","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"except"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben nichts als Nebel gesehen.","en":"We could see nothing but fog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717786","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},null,null,null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"nothing but"]]},{"text":"Wir konnten nichts sehen, außer Nebel.","en":"We could see nothing but fog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717787","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"except"},null]},{"text":"Morgens ist oft Nebel.","en":"There is often fog in the morning.","words":[{"g":"in the morning, a.m."},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"often"},null]},{"text":"Der Flughafen wurde wegen des Nebels gesperrt.","en":"The airport was closed because of the fog.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"airport"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"for, because of"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to bar","l":"sperren"}]}]}